  title: Gauge invariance of radiative jet functions in the position-space formulation of SCET
  authors: Bodwin, Geoffrey T.; Ee, June-Haak; Kang, Daekyoung; Wang, Xiang-Peng
  pub: Phys.Rev.D 109 2024 056020 5 publication
